{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxmneLzEnnbm7Gnsmt3d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**10 月 13 日（周二）布达佩斯美术馆是开放的。**\n\n一般说的\"布达佩斯美术馆\"是英雄广场旁的 **Szépművészeti Múzeum（Museum of Fine Arts）**。按我掌握的常规开放时间：\n\n- **周二至周日：10:00 – 18:00**\n- **周一闭馆**\n- 售票和最后入场通常在闭馆前约 1 小时，建议 17:00 前到。\n\n当天不是匈牙利法定节假日（10 月 23 日国庆才是），所以应该按正常时间开放。\n\n**建议出发前确认：**\n- 去官网 szepmuveszeti.hu 看一下，临时特展、维护闭馆或活动日可能调整时间。\n- 热门特展可能需要提前在线订票或预约时段。\n- 如果你说的是布达城堡里的**匈牙利国家美术馆（Magyar Nemzeti Galéria）**，那家常规也是周二至周日 10:00–18:00，周一闭馆，周二同样开放。\n\nVERDICT: OPEN"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":810,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":810},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bc11cc4-72fd-4b8e-a3f5-33fda388bdeb","uuid":"61dfd914-8934-4d56-9a4b-1ef050c57bb2","timestamp":"2026-11-12T09:10:03.304Z","request_id":"req_011CgxmndqEwVtaq954S5dgi"}
